{"id":"steam-819440","steam":819440,"igdb":null,"type":"game","title":"HAMMER WORLD: DIMENSION TRAVELER","summary":"\"HAMMER WORLD: DIMENSION TRAVELER\" is a first-person metroidvania with physics-based combat built in Unreal Engine 4. Explore mysterious dimensions, unlock new abilities, and fight back against evil with your hammer friend!","about":"WHAT IS HAMMER WORLD?\n\r\n\r\n\"HAMMER WORLD: DIMENSION TRAVELER\" is a first-person metroidvania with physics-based combat built in Unreal Engine 4. Explore mysterious dimensions, unlock new abilities, and fight back against evil with your hammer friend!\r\n\r\n\nGAME SYSTEM\n\r\n\r\nThis game features non-linear exploration through a variety of interconnected worlds. \r\n\r\nVenture forth and:\r\n\n• Upgrade your hammer and unlock new combat and traversal abilities!\r\n• Master the physics-based melee combat system!\r\n• Fight a variety of strange enemies and test your mettle against fearsome bosses!\r\n• Uncover secret areas and hidden challenges!\n\r\n\r\n\nMORE INFO SOON!\n\r\n\r\nHAMMER WORLD is currently in active development. More updates coming soon!","cover":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/819440/portrait.png?t=1566228465","coverFallback":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/819440/header.jpg?t=1566228465","banner":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/819440/page_bg_generated_v6b.jpg?t=1566228465","header":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/819440/header.jpg?t=1566228465","background":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/819440/page_bg_generated_v6b.jpg?t=1566228465","screenshots":[{"thumb":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/819440/ss_6757b7539bb9187bcf0da6d87b504e8ac6c89942.600x338.jpg?t=1566228465","full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/819440/ss_6757b7539bb9187bcf0da6d87b504e8ac6c